                "doc.wireless.jump_title": "Jumpstart Pulse:",
                "doc.wireless.jump_body": "Many brushless rotary motors require an initial 9V-12V burst to overcome cartridge membrane resistance from a standstill. Verify if your battery pack includes a jumpstart feature if your motor struggles to turn over at low voltages.",
                "doc.wireless.flutter_title": "Low-Charge Flutter:",
